WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.670
Yoshimori met the Princess,
the master of the Kokuboro.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.640
She gave him her power,
but he did not know who she was.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.900
He then went on to successfully
rescue Kagemiya.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:15.540
Tokine infiltrated the Kokuboro
in search for Yoshimori,

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.070
and defeated one of
the executives, Koshu.

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:21.780
In a place unknown to those two,

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:25.550
Matsudo Heisuke and Byaku
had a fight to the death.

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.490
With Kagami's help,
Matsudo defeated Byaku by a hair.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.820
So an old score,
which began 50 years ago,

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.660
had finally been settled.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.960
The collapse of the castle
continues to accelerate.

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:47.740
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:49.610
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:54.820
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.720
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:00.160
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:04.560
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.100
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.430
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:17.100
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.600
Sha la la la la...

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:28.020
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.980
(Secret romance)

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:35.190
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:36.950
(A strange distance)

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:43.800
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:44.870
Yeah

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:48.340
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:51.940
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:57.280
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:27.700
Another part collapsed.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:31.340
I better find Yoshimori soon
or I'll be crushed!

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.380
The Ayakashi are running away.

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:40.580
I guess I need to find out
what's going on.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:46.920
Is it okay to leave our post?

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:49.150
Who cares? We have to run.

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:52.920
We have an intruder!

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.400
A human girl!

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.030
She has to be that kid's friend!

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:58.660
That kid?!
They know about Yoshimori!

00:02:58.770 --> 00:02:59.770
Oh no!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:00.980
Hoi! Joso!

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:01.630
Ketsu!

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.080
You know about him, don't you?

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:21.320
Okay. This should do.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.090
Hey!

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:22.890
What?

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.900
Did you... beat all of them?

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:31.230
Well... these guys are easier since
they get knocked out easily...

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.930
But there are rooms here
with lots of weird ones.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.810
Someone warned me to
go through this place

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:38.970
as quickly and quietly as possible
without waking them up.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.740
Wait. Who told me that again?

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:07.300
Yoshimori?!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.070
Miss! Miss!

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.810
Please.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:11.940
Please let us go!

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:14.740
That's up to you.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.410
There should be another human here.

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.180
Tell me what you know!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:24.680
A human?! There was a human
in the dungeon.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.150
The dungeon? Where is that?!

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:29.520
Here! Just go straight down!

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.710
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.340
Miss!

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:46.610
Kai!

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.450
Run to wherever you want.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.420
- Let's get out of here!
- Let's get out of here!

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:06.920
Shut up.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:11.870
I hate these crawly things!
They give me the creeps.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.300
And why so many of them?!

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.240
Gross! Gross! Gross!

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.410
C-Calm down, Kagemiya.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:22.710
I-I'm going to barf...

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:26.520
D-Don't barf!
We'll escape up!

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:27.580
Ketsu!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:28.310
Metsu!

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:31.250
Kai!

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:36.790
Those bugs weren't coming after us.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.630
They weren't attacking us.
They were running away.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:46.610
I wonder if something
happened in the castle.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:49.740
Hey, are you okay?

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:56.610
You know... You're like a girl.

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:59.350
You're scared of those things?

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:02.880
Stabbed!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:06.550
You stabbed me! Hey!
You stabbed me!

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:10.230
I hate it when people
say that to me!

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.260
Don't ever say it again!

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.970
Don't get so mad.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:19.400
Damn it! If you're going to treat me
like a burden, then why did you rescue me?!

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:23.840
Why? Why not?
It's normal.

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.110
It's not normal!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.840
People like you always act like this.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.580
He was the same, too.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:48.360
He came to help
even when I didn't ask.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:51.570
And he took down enemies
in front of me.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.210
Just because he was strong...

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:06.620
He jumped at danger
while I hesitated...

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:10.520
as if it were nothing...

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:18.160
But it's not.
Most people are not like you guys.

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:22.440
I don't really understand, but...

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:26.900
I wouldn't care if
it was just about me.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.950
But I don't want any regrets...

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:37.890
I don't want to stand back and
just watch while someone gets hurt...

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:41.220
I really don't want that
to ever happen again.

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:50.590
Hey!

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.790
Hey! Why are you running
all of a sudden?!

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:57.870
Hey! Say something!

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.300
Kagemiya.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:01.860
What is it?

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.280
Go home.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.240
H-How?!

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:09.580
Mask your presence
and follow those bugs.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:13.120
I can't do that!
All those creepy crawlies!

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.820
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:16.810
- Hey!
- Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.990
Look! Over there!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.380
Tokiko...

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.000
I see...

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:09.780
The secret passage to the Kokuboro
is already complete...

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:15.310
I don't mind if you use it
since this is what I made it for.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.270
Thank you very much.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:20.350
All right. She agreed to it
without any hitches.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.480
Then we'd like to go right away.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:23.450
It's just that...

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:27.620
Their world is
starting to fall apart.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.920
It's only a matter of time
before it completely disintegrates.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:34.900
The powers of their Ayakashi master
must be reaching their limit.

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:39.900
Yes. It may be misleading to say
that the world will disappear...

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:41.840
but once it collapses,

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:44.470
the framework of
that world disappears.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.910
Then everything will
lose its shape.

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:48.980
Of course,

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.540
the ones still in that world
will be affected in the same way...

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:56.060
Tokine-chan, Sen and Yoshimori
are still on the other side.

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:03.220
Everyone, gather round.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:09.270
As you heard,
it's highly dangerous.

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:11.630
I'll limit the people that will go.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:14.430
First, Mukade and I will go.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:15.370
Yes.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.230
Also, Hakudo and Ohdo!

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:18.300
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:20.710
And...

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.050
Hakota!

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.070
Y-Yes?!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.120
M-Me?!

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:28.150
I will need your eyes to find them.

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:34.390
Yukimasa. You stay with Hakota.

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:35.420
Yes, sir.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:36.830
Chief! Me too!

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:38.220
I don't need two of you.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:40.160
Hatori.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:40.990
Yes.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.970
Stay behind and assume
command here.

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:47.700
Chief. May I confirm one thing?

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:49.100
What's that?

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:56.810
The goal is to rescue
those three and return, correct?

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:01.410
That's right.

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:02.780
Understood.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:05.660
I'm going.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.380
But Grandfather...

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:12.690
I will stay to maintain
this passage.

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.900
I will leave the other side to you...

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:19.170
But won't you be a burden to them?

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:20.330
What?!

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.710
Be quiet! I said I'm going!

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:47.160
My son! Boys have to be brave!

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:48.840
OK, Mommy! I'll try my best!

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:51.870
I'll be going now!

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.180
Tokiko. I am in your debt.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.140
Go!

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:08.680
Please be careful.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:13.120
Tokine...

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.600
This should be the lowest level
of the castle.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.200
Yoshimori?

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:28.800
Yoshimori!

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:37.710
There are traces of him...

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:41.250
Geez! Where did he go?!

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.000
He...

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:08.670
Hey, you...

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:18.660
You're looking for
that guy called Kaguro, huh?

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:23.960
I'll find him for you...

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.430
Find him?

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:33.400
But you don't know who he is.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:36.000
He's a strong Ayakashi, right?

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.310
The one who killed Gen...

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:46.310
Yeah...

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:50.350
Hey!

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:52.790
Hey! Kagemiya!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.050
Hey!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.090
It should be fine here.

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:04.500
What are you going to do?

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.230
I'm going to trace his aura.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:09.630
If he's a strong Ayakashi,
I can find his exact location.

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:11.440
Wow.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:16.420
I can track him once
I know his aura.

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:18.340
The only issue here
is the distance.

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:19.910
Wow!

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:24.120
Can all Half-Ayakashi do that?

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:26.090
Everybody's different.

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:31.260
I have especially keen senses.
It's my forte.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:32.990
Wow...

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:37.560
I can figure out their strengths,
abilities, what they're thinking...

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:40.810
Not everything,
but I can read a good amount.

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:42.470
Wow...

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:45.800
When I'm in good condition,
I can do the same with humans, too.

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:48.210
Wow...

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.820
But I can't get a good read on you.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:00.660
I'm going to maximize my senses
and narrow my target to one aura.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.800
When I do that,
I become vulnerable.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:06.360
Watch my back.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:08.160
Okay.

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.390
Ayakashi with auras
over a certain level...

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:43.090
One in the back to
the right on the roof.

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:45.570
One in the right-front side
in a building

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:47.440
in the middle floor
by the window...

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:51.970
One or two in
the lowest levels underground...

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:54.810
No, there's too much
going on to tell.

00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:59.210
There's another deep
in the rear-left side.

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.850
Hey! What are his features?!

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:02.820
Huh?!

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:04.620
I need clues to find him!

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.060
What are his abilities
or personality?

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:09.660
Uh... He's really quick...

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:13.760
And he can take out swords from
his hands to slash his opponents...

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:16.860
His personality is...

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:21.430
Huh? That's...

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:26.410
You idiot!
You're ruining my concentration!

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.940
Oh, yeah... that's right.

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:32.580
Sorry, Kagemiya.
It's impossible.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.380
Huh?!

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:39.820
They invented a skin where they can
disguise themselves as human.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.620
When they wear that,

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:43.860
their aura and scent
are sealed off...

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:46.160
and they're exactly like humans.

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:48.770
Kaguro was wearing that
just a while ago.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:51.530
So he won't be emitting any aura.

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:56.240
What the hell?!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.580
Hey! Don't take it out on stuff!

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.240
Tell me sooner!

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.440
And don't take it out on me!

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:05.510
This stinks!

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:07.540
I thought I could
finally be useful!

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:11.020
Uh, I mean...

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.960
Shut up! It's just...

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.130
You keep saving me but I'm...

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:20.060
What?

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.600
It's not like you owe me
or anything.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:24.270
Don't force yourself.

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.980
Forcing?! Don't say it like that!

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.170
That's not what I meant!

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.640
I got stabbed! Stabbed! Hey!

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.920
What is this creepy presence?

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:55.160
I-It's coming!
Something that should never come!

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:02.330
No!

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:03.470
Tokine?!

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:05.840
It can't be.
It has to be my imagination.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:08.940
Hey! Where are you going?!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.350
Sorry for the trouble.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:15.250
I'll take care of the rest
on my own.

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:16.620
Huh?!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:24.590
Go home. This place is
going to get more dangerous.

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.120
Why are you doing this?!

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:31.060
What's the point in fighting Kaguro
and getting revenge?!

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:34.130
It's not like he'll
come back to life!

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:37.140
Why are you putting yourself
in danger like that?!

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:46.950
Aren't you afraid... of dying?

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.750
You're definitely crazy!

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.520
I have to beat Kaguro
with my own hands!

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:54.550
Because...

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:59.000
That's the only way
I can repay Shishio!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:07.660
Yoshimori...

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:20.640
I'm not going to repay you
for this, okay?

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:24.410
You're about to collapse.
Just drop that act.

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.100
Yuck! I'm going to drop you!

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.360
What?!

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:34.030
Hey! Stop staggering!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:37.260
You're always so reckless.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.100
Think of the trouble you cause
to the people around you!

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:42.140
I already know how
reckless he can be.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:56.080
I didn't know you
were captured, too.

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:58.580
Well, excuse me for being captured.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.080
Ouch...

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:02.820
But is it true that you were
just with him?!

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:07.200
Yeah, he went off to fight
a guy called Kaguro.

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:11.470
Kaguro?!
Can he get any more reckless?!

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.630
Same goes for you...
What are you doing here?

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:18.740
He went off on his own,
so I came after him!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.880
You came here on your own?!

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:23.680
You knew how dangerous
this place is and you still came?!

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:28.140
I'm worried about Yoshimori...

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:33.420
You're fools... all of you.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.190
This is so stupid!

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:37.890
What's with all of you?!

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:39.020
What's wrong?

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:41.230
I'll find him for you.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:42.060
Huh?

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:46.610
I can track his presence!
I'll find him for you!

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.910
Where is his presence?

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:03.950
What happened?

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:07.980
I sensed an Ayakashi
with a really powerful aura.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:11.830
But it didn't feel sinister
for some reason...

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:13.560
Are you okay?

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.670
Yeah...

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.730
Where's Sumimura?!

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:29.870
I found him!

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:32.450
He's heading straight
toward Kaguro,

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:35.220
on the highest roof!

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.450
Ketsu, Ketsu, Ketsu!

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:41.220
Kaguro!

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:46.790
Yoshimori!

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:48.430
Over there!

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:54.330
Yoshimori!

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:02.410
Yoshimori!

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:03.210
Hey!

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:23.090
Why...

00:22:24.370 --> 00:22:27.200
Why?!

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:46.230
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:46.230 --> 00:22:52.930
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.500 --> 00:23:02.310
Joking around, I noticed after I laughed

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:08.650
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:18.490
You don't have to say anything, it's okay

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:24.860
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:33.940
Straight ahead, I'm pushing forward

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:41.470
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:43.220 --> 00:23:50.460
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:59.020
The red string connects one to another
